.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WEBHOOK EDIT"
.SH NAME
hamstik webhook edit \- Update a webhook endpoint
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik webhook edit [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update a webhook endpoint
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I WEBHOOK_ID
Webhook endpoint id
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --body-file
Read the JSON request body from this file; `-` reads stdin
.TP
.B --field
Structured JSON field as `key=value`; repeatable
.TP
.B --if-match
Current endpoint ETag
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Idempotency key override
